<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Boeing buy restated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Boeing buy restated.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- NatWest Securities &quot;strongly&quot; restated its buy rating and set a six-to-12 month price target of $125 a share.</p>
<p>-- said it expects fourth quarter earnings estimates of $0.92 a share to be realized or slightly exceeded.</p>
<p>-- expects 1997 orders to equal or exceed 1996's record levels. Expects orders to peak in 1998 and then plateau through 2000.</p>
<p>-- Boeing gained 1-3/8 to 106-1/2 in afternoon trading.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
